    {"problem": "Static shocks off every doorknob in February", "solution": "Cold outdoor air holds very little moisture, and forced-air heat dries it further. A whole-home humidifier on the furnace brings indoor humidity back to a comfortable level without a bucket humidifier in every bedroom."},
